Earth Science 8 Syllabus, 2026 to 2027
Mr. Halvard Dunmore, Linden Grove Middle School

Units: 1. Minerals. 2. Rocks and the rock cycle. 3. Plate tectonics. 4. Weather and climate. 5. Earth's history. 6. Space.

Grading | Weight
Tests | 40 percent
Labs | 30 percent
Homework | 20 percent
Participation | 10 percent

Late work: 10 percent off per day, accepted up to 3 days late. After that, see Mr. Dunmore.

Retakes: Students may retake one test per quarter if they complete the corrections sheet first.

Help: Mr. Dunmore holds office hours on Tuesdays and Thursdays from 3:05 pm to 3:45 pm.

The second quarter ends January 22.

The final exam is 90 minutes long and covers all six units.

Homework is turned in on paper in the blue tray by the door.
